# Docs & scanner

## Entry

- Tab `docs` in `Dashboard.jsx` → `DocsPage.jsx`.
- Scanner UI: `src/components/scanner/*` — `ScannerFlow`, `CameraCapture`, `PerspectiveCrop`, `DocOptimizer`, `ResultsView`.

## Pipeline

1. Capture pages → `scanPipeline.js` / `imageProcessing.js` / `backgroundRemoval.js`.
2. OCR + classification via `appApi.integrations.Core.InvokeLLM` with `response_json_schema` (`ocr_text`, `document_type`, `title`, `markdown_result`).
3. Persist as `appApi.entities.Document` + optional `Folder`.
4. Display markdown in `ResultsView` with **`SafeMarkdown`**.

## UX conventions

- German labels where existing (e.g. „Neuer Scan“, „Kein Text erkannt“).
- Folders: Inbox, Receipts, Contracts, etc. — align with Tax Vault handoff.
- Export: `src/lib/docs/export.js` (PDF/ZIP).

## Cross-module

- **→ Tax Vault**: receipt flow from document (scan as expense).
- **→ DocDraft**: `lib/docdraft/fromScan.js`.
- **→ Lawyer AI**: `DocumentPicker` attaches `Document` records.

## Do not

- Render LLM markdown without `SafeMarkdown`.
- Store API keys in scanner code.
- Add server routes here — scanner is client-only.

## Key components

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `ScannerFlow.jsx` | Orchestrates capture → process → save |
| `DocumentDetail.jsx` | View/edit saved document |
| `ProcessingOverlay.jsx` | Loading during OCR |

## OCR without API key

Demo JSON returned from `invokeLLMDemo` in `appApi.js` when Anthropic not configured.
